      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll try following those temps. i was also wondering about the 'bloom' itself—it looks almost like a growth or something appearing on the surface. is there any way that external factors like humidity or how it's stored could trigger that 'bloom' to show up more aggressively?",
